#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0037 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "Track B: adapted from FDA-SD0037-valid_empty-DM.cdt. Boundary: an empty ARMCD is not compared against the Define-XML codelist (only populated values are checked) -> no violation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#define-xml PMDA-SD0037-define.xml
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ARMCD   type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
col COUNTRY type=Char label="Country"
---
S1 | DM | 001 |   | USA
S1 | DM | 002 | A | DEU
